# ============================================================
#  上传到 GitHub 时不想提交的文件（Git 会照着这份清单忽略它们）
#  Files Git should ignore when you publish this to GitHub
# ============================================================

# 运行 / 测试产生的垃圾
# runtime and test leftovers
pak_tool.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
_test_area/
_e2e_area/
_sim_area/
.paktool_tmp_*
.paktool_bin_*
.paktool_spool/

# 打包 exe 的中间产物与成品
# exe build intermediates and output
build/
*.spec
pak_tool.exe
pak_tool/
SBpakTool-release/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 说明：上面把 pak_tool.exe 和两个官方 exe 之外的成品都排除掉了。
# 如果你想连 exe 一起放进仓库（不太推荐，二进制文件会让仓库变臃肿），
# 就把 pak_tool.exe 那几行删掉。
#
# Note: pak_tool.exe and the release folder are ignored on purpose -
# put the .exe in a GitHub "Release" instead of in the repository.
# Delete those lines if you really want the binary in the repo.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
